WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:03.010
SPEAKER: The cloud
has many benefits.

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:05.720
It gives you a platform for
more dynamic decision-making.

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:07.590
It helps accelerate innovation.

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:11.040
And it has the potential for
significant cost efficiencies.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.680
To realize that potential,
you need the right tools

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:17.610
to help you build a path to
more predictable cloud costs.

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:19.980
With Google Cloud's
cost management tools,

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:23.280
you can gain the visibility,
accountability, control,

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:26.760
and intelligence you need to
achieve greater predictability

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:29.130
and cost efficiencies
in the cloud.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:31.470
Designed for organizations
of all sizes,

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:34.770
these tools make it easy to see
your current and future costs

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:38.250
with built-in reporting and
customizable dashboards.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:41.160
Not only can you see your costs,
you can increase accountability

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:44.730
for them by allocating costs to
specific departments and teams

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:46.800
within your
organization, meaning

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.470
you can truly understand
the return on your cloud

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:50.610
investment.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:52.620
You can also control
who can do the spending

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:55.896
with easily configurable
policies and permissions.

00:00:55.896 --> 00:00:57.270
These strong
financial governance

00:00:57.270 --> 00:01:00.450
controls help you more
effectively plan and reduce

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:02.400
the risk of overspending.

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:04.379
And you can stay smart
about your spending

00:01:04.379 --> 00:01:06.300
with intelligent
recommendations tailored

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:09.360
to your business that help
further optimize your usage

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:11.970
while minimizing costs.

00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:14.340
Google Cloud cost
management, the path

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.880
to predictable cloud costs.

